        "source_id": "python-3.14.7-docs",
        "start": 582,
        "text": "* **ensure_ascii** (*bool*) -- If \"True\" (the default), the output is guaranteed to have all incoming non-ASCII and non- printable characters escaped. If \"False\", all characters will be outputted as-is, except for the characters that must be escaped: quotation mark, reverse solidus, and the control characters U+0000 through U+001F.",
