        "score": 0.4006371212889504,
        "section": "stdtypes",
        "source_id": "python-3.14.7-docs",
        "start": 0,
        "text": "Return \"True\" if all bytes in the sequence are alphabetical ASCII characters or ASCII decimal digits and the sequence is not empty, \"False\" otherwise. Alphabetic ASCII characters are those byte values in the sequence \"b'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ'\". ASCII decimal digits are those byte values in the sequence \"b'0123456789'\".",
        "title": "stdtypes"
      },
